.TH MARK-SHOT-UPLOAD 1 "August 2026" "Mark Shot 0.1.49" "User Commands"
.SH NAME
mark-shot-upload \- upload a Mark Shot image
.SH SYNOPSIS
.B /usr/libexec/mark-shot/mark-shot-upload
.RB [ \-\-format
.BR json ]
.I image
.SH DESCRIPTION
Uploads an image using the hosting provider selected through the Mark Shot
upload environment configuration and prints the resulting URL as JSON.
.SH ENVIRONMENT
Upload provider, endpoint, authentication, and response fields are configured
through variables documented in the Mark Shot configuration guide.
.SH SEE ALSO
.BR mark-shot (1)
